{{#if metadata.expiresAt}}
<p style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 24px; text-align: center; color: #43404A;">
  Your account has been temporarily suspended due to a policy violation. You won't be able to log in until the suspension is lifted.
</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; text-align: center; color: #43404A;">
  <strong>Ban period:</strong> {{durationDays metadata.bannedAt metadata.expiresAt}}<br>
  <strong>Reason:</strong> {{metadata.reason}}
</p>
{{else}}
<p style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 24px; text-align: center; color: #43404A;">
  Your account has been permanently banned due to a policy violation.
</p>
{{/if}}
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; text-align: center; color: #43404A;">
  If you want to understand what happened, contact Support.
</p>
